WEBVTT

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.094
NDB: So that's our two myths:

00:01:30.118 --> 00:01:31.765
virgins bleed,

00:01:31.789 --> 00:01:33.999
and hymens are lost forever.

00:01:35.301 --> 00:01:38.460
Now, this may sound
like a minor issue to you.

00:01:38.484 --> 00:01:40.080
Why should you care

00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:44.541
about an obscure little skin fold
on the female body?

00:01:45.823 --> 00:01:49.028
But the truth is,
this is about so much more

00:01:49.052 --> 00:01:51.893
than an anatomical misunderstanding.

00:01:53.186 --> 00:01:57.166
The myths about the hymen
have lived on for centuries

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:59.578
because they have cultural significance.